    "description": "<p>The creature regards the charmer as its best friend and tries to defend the charmer against threats, real or imagined. If they share a language, the creature usually follows suggestions. It may refuse an order that contradicts its nature, and it will not kill itself.</p><p>The charm ends if the charmer attacks the creature. Otherwise the creature may save again after a period based on its Intelligence: each day if high (13–18), each week if average (9–12), or each month if low (3–8).</p>",
